{"name": "exec", "call_id": "call_c9a5277022674747bb8e2b6ec519554d", "input": "text(await tools.apply_patch("*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/output/refined-ui/finish_grok_docs.py\n+from pathlib import Path\n+repo=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]/'project'\n+texts={\n+'ouo/README.md':'''# Grok Ball / LVGL\n+\n+OuO 入口现使用 [tycoding/grok-ball](https://github.com/tycoding/grok-ball) 的表情引擎。上游固定在 de368ce3acdc5a70e871ee46ebbe8f60b11d3d6a，原文件未改写，MIT 许可和来源哈希在 vendor/ 保留。LVGL 适配代码为 Apache-2.0。\n+\n+保留上游 32 种表情、48 点眼睛轮廓、动画、注视、自旋彩带和 AI emotionId 接口。浏览器 SVG 场景映射到原生 LVGL 多边形，没有 WebView。填充按完整轮廓扫描，避免三角形拼接细线和缺口。渐变目前取中间色，字体和抗锯齿由 LVGL 绘制，因此不是浏览器逐像素复刻。\n+\n+触摸时眼睛跟随，轻点自旋，左右滑动切换表情。底部可启动/停止巡演或进入思考状态。表情使用本包 storage 保存，跨重启保存取决于数据文件系统。\n+\n+## 文件和生成\n+\n+- vendor/grok-ball.js：固定版本的上游引擎。\n+- grok_lvgl_adapter.js：SVG 节点、坐标和绘制适配。\n+- grok_app.js：主题、布局、触摸、存储和兼容接口。\n+- app.js、ouo_resource.c：由 python tools/generate_grok_ouo.py 生成，勿独立编辑。\n+\n+生成器同步内置应用、ESPClaw 示例、清单和嵌入资源。保留原 OuO 包名、目录和 CLI 入口，显示名 Grok Ball，版本 2.0.0。状态 ID 改用上游定义，详见 DESIGN.md。\n+\n+## 验证边界\n+\n+tests/test_grok_ball_app.js 验证两主题全部状态、触摸、滑动、AI 回退、彩带、巡演和暂停。真实 QuickJS / LVGL 离线渲染器输出全部 32 种表情及动画阶段，ASan / UBSan 检查原生绘制和控件生命周期。\n+\n+本次仅编译 ESP32-P4 固件及离线审核截图，未刷机。实板帧率、触摸手感和长期稳定性尚未验证；旧 OuO 实板记录不代表本移植版已通过实板验证。\n+''',\n+'ouo/DESIGN.md':'''# Grok Ball LVGL adaptation\n+\n+The upstream engine is retained verbatim. VelaMood remains the compatibility facade; states now follow Grok Ball rather than the previous Mood Console meanings.\n+\n+## State protocol\n+\n+IDs: 00..07, 10..21, 30..41 (32 total). 00 is sleep, 02 idle, 10 happy, 30 thinking. GrokBall.EMOTIONS is the authoritative table. Old IDs 08 and 09, missing fields, malformed JSON and unknown IDs fall back to 02. AI prompts using old meanings must be updated.\n+\n+```js\n+VelaMood.handleAIMessage({emotionId: '30', tips: '正在分析任务'});\n+VelaMood.setEmotion('10');\n+VelaMood.setGaze(0.5, -0.2); // normalized coordinates\n+VelaMood.startTour(1800);\n+VelaMood.stopTour();\n+```\n+\n+Messages also accept JSON strings. Explicit selections save through package storage; tour changes do not repeatedly write storage.\n+\n+## Rendering\n+\n+One native 50 ms interval drives the engine. A minimal scene adapter handles the SVG commands/transforms used in the pinned version. Filled contours are scanned once, strokes use LVGL lines. SVG painter order is preserved by ui.front; removed FX nodes release native widgets.\n+\n+ui.polygon(points, color, opacity, stroke) creates a non-interactive contour; ui.polygonSet(handle, points, color, opacity, stroke) updates it. Each contour has 3..128 integer points, coordinates -8192..8192, opacity 0..255 and stroke 0..8. Arguments are converted before committing updates; generation checks reject widget removal during JS property getters. ui.front(handle) raises a widget.\n+\n+Body/eyes use consistent theme colors. Gradients use the middle stop; text is native. Host fidelity and sanitizers do not establish real-device performance.\n+''',\n+'app/espdl-quickapp/overlay/apps/system/espclaw/qpk/ouo/README.md':'''# Grok Ball：ESPClaw 参考项目\n+\n+设备路径 /data/qpk/.examples/ouo/，保留 OuO 示例 ID。显示名 Grok Ball，版本 2.0.0。\n+\n+用途：32 种表情、触摸注视、自旋彩带、滑动切换、AI emotionId 与有限动画定时器。源码与 desktop/ouo/app.js 逐字节一致，由 tools/generate_grok_ouo.py 生成；SHA-256 在父目录 catalog.json 记录。\n+\n+上游 https://github.com/tycoding/grok-ball ，固定版本 de368ce3acdc5a70e871ee46ebbe8f60b11d3d6a。MIT 许可保留于 app.js，适配代码 Apache-2.0。SVG 渐变取中间色，不是逐像素复刻。\n+\n+状态 ID：00..07、10..21、30..41。00 睡眠，02 待机，10 开心，30 思考；未知 ID 回退 02。勿使用旧 OuO 含义。\n+\n+tests/test_grok_ball_app.js 验证两主题、全部状态、触摸、滑动、AI 回退、自旋、巡演和暂停。真实 QuickJS / LVGL 离线渲染检查状态及生命周期。未刷机，实板性能尚未验证；旧 OuO 实板记录不适用于本版。\n+\n+新应用应由生成器分配 ai.<slug> 包名。尺寸使用 ui.getSize() 内容区域，勿复制示例包名。\n+'''}\n+for name,text in texts.items():(repo/name).write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')\n+readme=repo/'app/espdl-quickapp/README.md'\n+text=readme.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\n+if '## Grok Ball LVGL port' not in text:\n+    readme.write_text(text+'\\n## Grok Ball LVGL port\\n\\nOuO now launches Grok Ball 2.0.0 using the pinned MIT upstream engine and native SVG contour adaptation. See ../../ouo/README.md for source/license, state migration and validation limits. The CLI/package identifiers remain compatible. Native host render and ESP32-P4 build are review evidence only; no flashing or hardware performance validation was performed.\\n',encoding='utf-8')\n+build=Path(__file__).parent/'build_refined.py'\n+text=build.read_text(encoding='utf-8').replace(\"'qpk_polygon.inc','ouo_resource.c'\",\"'qpk_polygon.inc','ouo_resource.c','glass_qpk_assets.inc'\")\n+build.write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')\n*** End Patch"));
