{"name": "exec", "call_id": "call_6d7d57c50d344663aa8fae8744e97a33", "input": "text(await tools.apply_patch("*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/project/app/espdl-quickapp/tests/test_grok_performance.cjs\n@@\n staticScene();\n+function recycledScene(){\n+  const live=new Set(),order=[];let id=0;\n+  const ui={polygon(){let h=1;while(live.has(h))h++;live.add(h);order.push(h);return h;},polygonSet(){},setHidden(){},front(h){assert(live.has(h));order.splice(order.indexOf(h),1);order.push(h);},remove(h){assert(live.delete(h));order.splice(order.indexOf(h),1);}};\n+  const ctx=vm.createContext({ui});vm.runInContext(after.slice(0,after.indexOf('var document=')),ctx);\n+  const port=ctx.GrokPort,root=port.mount(1024,600),back=new port.Node('g');root.appendChild(back);\n+  function path(){const node=new port.Node('path');node.setAttribute('d','M 0 0 L 100 0 L 50 100 Z');node.setAttribute('fill','#fff');return node;}\n+  const rear=path();back.appendChild(rear);root.appendChild(path());port.sync();assert.deepEqual(order,[1,2]);\n+  rear.remove();back.appendChild(path());port.sync();assert.deepEqual(order,[1,2],'reusing a rear ribbon handle must restore painter order even when the numeric sequence is unchanged');\n+  const circle=new port.Node('circle');circle.setAttribute('r','5');circle.setAttribute('fill','#fff');root.appendChild(circle);port.sync();const geometry=circle.cachedContours;\n+  circle.setAttribute('opacity','0.5');circle.setAttribute('transform','translate(30,40)');port.sync();assert.strictEqual(circle.cachedContours,geometry,'opacity and movement must not rebuild the local circle');\n+}\n+recycledScene();\n*** Add File: [PROJECT_WORKSPACE]/project/app/espdl-quickapp/POLYGON_API.md\n+# 原生轮廓接口\n+\n+原有 `ui.polygon(points, color, opacity, stroke, gradient)` 和 `ui.polygonSet(handle, points, color, opacity, stroke, gradient)` 保持兼容。`points` 是 `[[x, y], ...]`，包含 3～128 个点，坐标范围为 −8192～8192。轮廓自动闭合；`stroke=0` 表示填充。\n+\n+高频动画可使用 `ui.polygonBuffer(buffer, color, opacity, stroke, gradient)` 和 `ui.polygonSetBuffer(handle, buffer, color, opacity, stroke, gradient)`。传入完整 `ArrayBuffer`，按本机字节序存放交错的有符号 32 位 x/y 坐标；建议由精确长度的 `Int32Array` 构造：\n+\n+```javascript\n+const points = new Int32Array([20, 20, 80, 20, 20, 80]);\n+const handle = ui.polygonBuffer(points.buffer, 0xabcdef, 255, 0);\n+points[0] = 24;\n+ui.polygonSetBuffer(handle, points.buffer, 0xabcdef, 255, 0);\n+```\n+\n+函数同步复制坐标，不持有 JS 缓冲区。调用返回后可以继续复用或修改该数组；只有更新接口会更新图形。不能直接传入 `Int32Array` 对象，也不能把一个子数组的整个底层缓冲区当作该子数组传入。缓冲区长度必须为 24～1024 字节且是 8 的倍数；已分离的缓冲区会被拒绝。\n+\n+颜色为 RGB 整数，默认 `0xffffff`；透明度默认 255，范围裁剪为 0～255；线宽默认 0，裁剪为 0～8。可选渐变格式沿用数组接口：\n+\n+```text\n+[kind, stopCount, x1, y1, x2, y2, radius, offset0, color0, ...]\n+```\n+\n+`kind=1` 为径向，`kind=2` 为线性；色标数 2～5，位置在 0～1 之间且非递减。坐标与半径必须有限，径向半径必须大于零。坐标缓冲区在其他参数转换前完成快照，后续参数的 getter 即使分离缓冲区也不会造成悬空读取；更新时保留控件代际校验，避免参数转换期间删除并复用编号后写入新控件。\n+\n+旧固件没有缓冲区接口时，应用应检查两个方法是否存在，再使用原有数组接口。Grok Ball 已实现该兼容回退。此接口与普通轮廓共享绘制路径、刷新裁剪、校验和生命周期，不提供应用专属超时或额外后台线程。\n*** End Patch"));
